  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pillar 3 -RDEL- Promoting sustainable alternative livelihoods in deforestation hotspots</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of Pillar 3 activities, TEFOS will provide technical assistance, consultancy services, prefeasibility studies, forestry and agricultural extension services in the deforestation hotspots selected by the government. These resources will also include admin fees charged by the provider.</narrative>
  </description>
